title: Stegerwald's reform reaches it's logical conclusion.
subtitle: Future of the Zentrum is slowly creeping...
tags: event
new-page: true
face-image: img/dnvp/reform_steggy.png
view-if: month == 8 and year >= 1929 and stegerwald_reform == 1
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!

// ===== Demographic mood on the reform (confession-split, 0-100 normalized) =====
const demo_support = {
    workers_protestants:      0.85,
    new_middle_protestants:   0.80,
    old_middle_protestants:   0.55,
    rural_protestants:        0.50,
    unemployedc_protestants:  0.75,

    workers_catholics:        0.55,
    new_middle_catholics:     0.45,
    old_middle_catholics:     0.10,
    rural_catholics:          0.10,
    unemployedc_catholics:    0.30,
};

const demo_keys = [
    'workers_protestants_z_display', 'new_middle_protestants_z_display',
    'old_middle_protestants_z_display', 'rural_protestants_z_display',
    'unemployedc_protestants_z_display',
    'workers_catholics_z_display', 'new_middle_catholics_z_display',
    'old_middle_catholics_z_display', 'rural_catholics_z_display',
    'unemployedc_catholics_z_display'
];

let demo_total = 0;
let demo_weighted_support = 0;

demo_keys.forEach(key => {
    const val = Q[key] || 0;
    const shortKey = key.replace('_z_display', '');
    const support = demo_support[shortKey] !== undefined ? demo_support[shortKey] : 0.5;
    demo_total += val;
    demo_weighted_support += val * support;
});

const demo_support_pct = demo_total > 0 ? (demo_weighted_support / demo_total) : 0.5;

// ===== Faction shares (z_*_power trackers, untouched by demo code) =====
const total_power = Q.z_clerical_power + Q.z_left_labor_power + Q.z_right_labor_power + Q.z_moderate_power;

const share_clerical = Q.z_clerical_power / total_power;
const share_left = Q.z_left_labor_power / total_power;
const share_right = Q.z_right_labor_power / total_power;
const share_moderate = Q.z_moderate_power / total_power;

const support_clerical = 0.0;
const support_left = 0.30;
const support_right = 1.0;

let support_moderate = 0.5;

// Electoral performance — display vs display, same scale
if (Q.z_votes_display >= Q.old_z_r) {
    support_moderate += 0.15;
} else if (Q.z_votes_display < Q.old_z_r * 0.9) {
    support_moderate -= 0.20;
}

if (Q.z_relation >= 70) {
    support_moderate += 0.15;
} else if (Q.z_relation < 50) {
    support_moderate -= 0.15;
}

if (Q.ideology == "left") {
    support_moderate += 0.20;
} else if (Q.ideology == "labor") {
    support_moderate -= 0.10;
} else if (Q.ideology == "reformist") {
    support_moderate -= 0.15;
}

if (Q.secularized == 1) {
    support_moderate -= 0.20;
}

// Demographic mood nudges moderates, dampened
support_moderate += (demo_support_pct - 0.5) * 0.6;

support_moderate = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, support_moderate));

// ===== Final weighted result =====
Q.stegerwald_reform_support_pct = (
    share_clerical * support_clerical +
    share_left * support_left +
    share_right * support_right +
    share_moderate * support_moderate
) * 100;

Q.stegerwald_reform_passes = Q.stegerwald_reform_support_pct >= 50 ? 1 : 0;

window.enableFocusMode()

!}



= Conclusion of the reform

Following the announcement of the reform, Stegerwald has exercised his leadership position to strike the multiple deals with non catholic unions and organizations, especially of protestant affiliation, which caused conflicts surprisingly not with Left Labor, but with Clericals and Dead Center, who argued for the mono identity of the party as of the party of catholics. Adam Stegerwald has responded to this, reminding them of Vatican's influence and their passiveness (which was caused due to their kingmaker's status and greed for power in government), which he seeks to combat and at some point cut short with socialists of the SPD forever.

Will he win?

- @resultant: Result

@resultant
go-to: steggy_win if stegerwald_reform_support_pct >= 50; steggy_lose if stegerwald_reform_support_pct < 50

@steggy_win
on-arrival: z_ideology = "Christian Conservatism"; workers_z += 10; new_middle_z += 5; rural_z -= 8; old_middle -= 8; z_transition_cvp = 1
go-to: steggy_full if stegerwald_reform_support_pct >= 65; steggy_lite if stegerwald_reform_support_pct < 65

Az the result of victory of Adam Stegerwald in his attempt to reform the party, he took over and pushed his package reforms, breaking the strength of clericals and opposition inside the party, eliminating "Catholic Action" group, breaking ties with catholic organizations and forming new ties with protestant local organizations. 

This has results in the **Great Exodus** of catholics and old middle class elements, their positions being replaced by the youth, workers, white collars (despite their early conflict with Stegerwald) and protestants. Catholics find themselves abandoned and are filling up different parties, breaking coherence of catholic movement, perhaps, **forever**...

Pro-reform votes: [+ stegerwald_reform_support_pct +]% / 100%

@steggy_full
on-arrival: z_relation -= 30; z_transition_cvp = 1
on-departure: {!
window.disableFocusMode()
!}

But, the most profound change comes from the new position accepted in the Evangelical Social Congress: Zentrum officially transforms into the Christian People's Party, umbrella party of catholics and protestants (de-facto situation is that Stegerwald's reforms have empowered christian unions and working class, causing frictions with it's donors and religious organizations, less so with protestants). It's main program is unification of **whole Right of the Weimar**, separation of the Labor from marxism / socialism and advancement of the **Volksgemeinschaft**, concept of national unification of Germany.

[? if z_in_government and spd_in_government: Whatever coalition we are in, it's very unlikely that CVP will consider remaining in it so long right has majority. ?]

@steggy_lite
on-arrival: z_relation -= 10; z_transition_cvp = 2
on-departure: {!
window.disableFocusMode()
!}

Steggy aint evil that much

@steggy_lose
on-departure: {!
window.disableFocusMode()
!}
on-arrival: z_party_leader = "Joseph Joos" if prussian_concordat == 1; z_party_leader = "Ludwig Kaas" if not prussian_concordat

After the failure of Adam Stegerwald to adequately appease the Zentrum and show appeals of new direction, Stegerwald was ousted from his position, leaving his reform none of worth. 

[? if prussian_concordat == 1: With clericals unable to impose their leadership, Joseph Joos has been instated as the new leader. ?] [? if not prussian_concordat: Clericals and moderates are able to push Ludwig Kaas despite his own protests. Nothing will change. ?]

Pro-reform votes: [+ stegerwald_reform_support_pct +]
